02:37.835 --> 02:44.900
Here comes friction Feel the fire Burning up

02:44.980 --> 02:53.266
with a desire A sheet of flame A crimson glow The

02:53.386 --> 02:58.270
only way we know to go We're coming home Breaking

02:58.350 --> 03:05.975
