03:22.342 --> 03:24.043
Burning up

03:58.572 --> 04:05.135
Here comes the friction, feel the fire Burning

04:05.456 --> 04:13.179
up with my desire Like a sheet of flame, a crimson

04:13.239 --> 04:18.262
